      "criterion": "equivalence",
      "problem": "The English sets a threshold with 'excessive lethargy'. In 特别嗜睡、没精神, the word 特别 can be read as applying only to 嗜睡, which leaves 没精神 unqualified. A patient could then read ordinary low energy after surgery as a reason to call, which lowers the threshold.",
